# cargo xtask oracle — the committed floor. Regenerate with `cargo xtask oracle --bless`.
#
# A floor, not an equality: the heuristic pass will never match a compiler frontend,
# and demanding parity is how a test gets deleted rather than fixed. The oracle fails
# when a measurement drops below its row, so these numbers only ever go up.
#
# fixture              precision  recall  edges
a-inherent-same-name        1.00    0.50      4
b-generic-bound             1.00    0.67      3
c-trait-object              1.00    0.67      3
d-reexport-chain            1.00    1.00      1
e-aliased-import            1.00    1.00      1
f-macro-generated           1.00    0.00      1
g-renamed-symbol            1.00    1.00      1
